  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Blue Marlin is a family friendly home with everything you'll need for an easy relaxing vacation away from home! We are in a cozy quiet area centrally located in the heart of Santa Rosa Beach, Fl We are one and a half miles from Seaside. It is an easy bike ride or walk to restaurants, shopping and to the public beach access to our beautiful beach on 30A We also have some of the best golf courses! We have a king master and a master bathroom with a double shower with rainforest shower head, freestanding bathtub, double sinks and private water closet. We have a queen room also connected to a full bath and a bunk room with 4 queen bunks. upstairs with its own full bath. Our home sleeps 12. We have outdoor seating, a firepit, and table & chairs for dining outside in pretty weather. We look forward to hosting your next vacation.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Blue Marlin"
        }
      ],
